        "MINER_TYPHOONUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "Miner: Grand Mastery",
        "MINER_TYPHOONUNLOCKABLE_UNLOCKABLE_NAME": "矿工：大师",
        "MINER_TYPHOONUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_DESC": "作为矿工，在台风或日食中击败游戏或消灭.\n<color=#8888>（台风难度需要星暴2）</color>",
        "MINER_MONSOONUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "Miner: Mastery",
